{"Intent":"Show each team's mean score in the weekly report.","Target":"c39fb76760b541e3d798e4ada78ff338f14a5beb","Head":"14f62d6cd9a07bc7f0f34a81af334c173c81a801","Diff":"diff --git a/report/team.go b/report/team.go
